# Distance sensor
# Level 3 - Sensors and motors
#
# Measure how far away something is with an ultrasonic sensor.
# You learn: the ultrasonic library, lengths in cm, and 'none' for "no answer".
# You need: an HC-SR04: VCC to 5V, Trig to pin 7, Echo to pin 8, GND to GND.

board uno
use mujard.ultrasonic

sonar = Ultrasonic(trig: pin 7, echo: pin 8)

every 200 ms:
    var d = sonar.distance()       # a length, or none when nothing echoes back
    if d == none:                  # Mujard makes you check before using it
        print "Nothing in range"
    else:
        print "Distance: {d as cm}"
